         *

         * <pre>{@code

         * builder.setHeader("name", "email", "phone");

         * }</pre>

         * <p>

         * The header is also used by the {@link CSVPrinter}.

         * </p>

         * <p>

         * This method keeps a copy of the input array.

         * </p>

